\boxed{|z|^2}

The magnitude of $z$ is given by $|z| = 5$. We want to find the magnitude of $z^2$, which is $|z^2|$.

We know that $|z^2| = |z \cdot z| = |z| \cdot |z| = |z|^2$.
Since $|z| = 5$, we have $|z^2| = |z|^2 = 5^2 = 25$.

Thus, $|\ovdrlind{z}^2| = |z|^2 = 5^2 = 25$.

